# "free" in believe_free is used only in S3, in P6 and P7. Both mean the same thing: believing one's actions are uncaused or self-determined. So it is in one sense.
# "cause" appears both as the things believed to cause pleasure or pain (P2) and as the idea of oneself as cause (C1, P4, P5). These are different claims, and the word has the same efficient-cause sense in each. So there is no bridge.
